  "findings": [
    "The parent group and called Bazel group differ. The called github.workflow value is blocking-ci, not Bazel. There is no matching parent/callee group in this call tree.",
    "Exactly one repository call site invokes bazel.yml. The calling job has no matrix, concurrency, or with block. Bazel matrices are internal, have fail-fast false, and have no job-level concurrency to make matrix children cancel one another.",
    "The other seven called workflows in the blocking closure have neither workflow-level nor job-level concurrency. Their job-level with parameters do not supply a hidden concurrency group.",
    "All 93 workflows contain no job-level concurrency and no declared concurrency-group input or corresponding with key. The string concurrency-group:: in bazel.yml is a literal prefix of the group expression, not a caller-provided input.",
    "Known independent v8, UI and Objective groups are different from the blocking and Bazel groups. Their cancellation cannot be attributed to a shared group merely from these fixed definitions.",
    "No workflow change, dispatch, rerun, cancel, or ref mutation is justified by this static exclusion alone."
  ],
  "remaining_limits": [
    "The definitions intentionally permit a later run with the same computed group to cancel an earlier in-progress run. Unchanged head/base does not itself prove that no such run, rerun, or same branch-label event existed.",
    "The parent key uses the source branch label rather than a globally unique PR identity. Another PR with the same head.ref can share that key; no such competing invocation has been demonstrated here.",
    "The saved run query is filtered to one head SHA. It is not an exhaustive history of all repository concurrency groups, other heads, actor actions, or external automation.",
    "Source analysis cannot identify a cancellation actor or distinguish service-side/manual cancellation. The staggered job end times are not a causal proof.",
    "The API run status queued does not negate completed/running individual job records. Preserve all original failed and cancelled results; no gate is closed by this receipt."
  ],
